{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854560/extras/dbbabe2fb2db647e7fdc2776de9a8adb.poster.avif?t=1712155414\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854560/extras/dbbabe2fb2db647e7fdc2776de9a8adb.webm?t=1712155414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854560/extras/dbbabe2fb2db647e7fdc2776de9a8adb.mp4?t=1712155414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Last Loremaster is a heart-racing, thrill-chasing ARPG with roguelike elements (\u00e0 la Hades or Darksiders), where accessing forbidden knowledge and power is as easy as changing your grip. <br><br>Play as Jahir\u2013the titular Last Loremaster\u2013as you make your way to the source of the Unravelling, a strange force that undoes and erases everything it touches. Switch between the six elemental Lores (Fire, Water, Earth, Wind, Lightning, and Nature) to crush your enemies and beat back the encroaching Unravelling.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVISCERATE YOUR ENEMIES WITH ELEMENTAL COMBOS</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854560/extras/ddccdc9437b336de42fac23866bc27b5.poster.avif?t=1712155414\" width=600 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854560/extras/ddccdc9437b336de42fac23866bc27b5.webm?t=1712155414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854560/extras/ddccdc9437b336de42fac23866bc27b5.mp4?t=1712155414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Seamlessly combine your elemental abilities to eviscerate your enemies with smooth, dynamic combat. Identify your enemies\u2019 weak points with the precision of Wind, then come down on them hard with the fury of Fire in the next moment!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNLOCK NEW ABILITIES &amp; CHOOSE YOUR BUILD</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854560/extras/18f37143dcd55de617e69c6c1625c688.poster.avif?t=1712155414\" width=600 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854560/extras/18f37143dcd55de617e69c6c1625c688.webm?t=1712155414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854560/extras/18f37143dcd55de617e69c6c1625c688.mp4?t=1712155414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The other Loremasters didn\u2019t leave much behind\u2013 only fragments remain. Upgrade and augment your weapons and gear piece by piece, truly making them your own! Choose which Elemental powers to focus on, unlock new abilities &amp; augments and meld the elements in unique and novel ways!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEFEND YOUR WORLD FROM THE UNRAVELLING</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854560/extras/1a3c7f52bd5df7ae1c92ccfb75ec07ae.poster.avif?t=1712155414\" width=600 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854560/extras/1a3c7f52bd5df7ae1c92ccfb75ec07ae.webm?t=1712155414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854560/extras/1a3c7f52bd5df7ae1c92ccfb75ec07ae.mp4?t=1712155414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Explore, defend, and remember. How far has the world fallen? How much is left to save? Last Loremaster features a myriad of different areas to explore and dozens of enemies to overcome, including familiar and new foes alike.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>6 unique ability sets you can switch between at will\u2013 one for each forbidden elemental Lore. <br></li><li>Fluid, high-octane combat system with physics-based animations.<br></li><li>Deep gear customization system, allowing you to choose the way you fight.<br></li><li>Stunning fantasy-apocalyptic world with Arabic inspiration and intricate lore.<br></li><li>Vast array of dozens of enemies to test your strength and strategy against.<br></li><li>Immersive, expressive, and impactful hand-crafted visuals, sound effects, and music</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854560/extras/2e690571bd09f56fc94ce5dac671ce06.poster.avif?t=1712155414\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854560/extras/2e690571bd09f56fc94ce5dac671ce06.webm?t=1712155414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854560/extras/2e690571bd09f56fc94ce5dac671ce06.mp4?t=1712155414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2854560?t=1712155414","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854560/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1712155414","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854560/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1712155414","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854560/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1712155414","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2868090,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854560/extras/adefbc43ce92516a168bdb58df7a9463.avif?t=1712155414\" width=540 height=3140 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854560/extras/dbbabe2fb2db647e7fdc2776de9a8adb.poster.avif?t=1712155414\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854560/extras/dbbabe2fb2db647e7fdc2776de9a8adb.webm?t=1712155414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854560/extras/dbbabe2fb2db647e7fdc2776de9a8adb.mp4?t=1712155414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Last Loremaster is a heart-racing, thrill-chasing ARPG with roguelike elements (\u00e0 la Hades or Darksiders), where accessing forbidden knowledge and power is as easy as changing your grip. <br><br>Play as Jahir\u2013the titular Last Loremaster\u2013as you make your way to the source of the Unravelling, a strange force that undoes and erases everything it touches. Switch between the six elemental Lores (Fire, Water, Earth, Wind, Lightning, and Nature) to crush your enemies and beat back the encroaching Unravelling.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVISCERATE YOUR ENEMIES WITH ELEMENTAL COMBOS</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854560/extras/ddccdc9437b336de42fac23866bc27b5.poster.avif?t=1712155414\" width=600 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854560/extras/ddccdc9437b336de42fac23866bc27b5.webm?t=1712155414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854560/extras/ddccdc9437b336de42fac23866bc27b5.mp4?t=1712155414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Seamlessly combine your elemental abilities to eviscerate your enemies with smooth, dynamic combat. Identify your enemies\u2019 weak points with the precision of Wind, then come down on them hard with the fury of Fire in the next moment!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNLOCK NEW ABILITIES &amp; CHOOSE YOUR BUILD</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854560/extras/18f37143dcd55de617e69c6c1625c688.poster.avif?t=1712155414\" width=600 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854560/extras/18f37143dcd55de617e69c6c1625c688.webm?t=1712155414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854560/extras/18f37143dcd55de617e69c6c1625c688.mp4?t=1712155414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The other Loremasters didn\u2019t leave much behind\u2013 only fragments remain. Upgrade and augment your weapons and gear piece by piece, truly making them your own! Choose which Elemental powers to focus on, unlock new abilities &amp; augments and meld the elements in unique and novel ways!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEFEND YOUR WORLD FROM THE UNRAVELLING</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854560/extras/1a3c7f52bd5df7ae1c92ccfb75ec07ae.poster.avif?t=1712155414\" width=600 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854560/extras/1a3c7f52bd5df7ae1c92ccfb75ec07ae.webm?t=1712155414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854560/extras/1a3c7f52bd5df7ae1c92ccfb75ec07ae.mp4?t=1712155414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Explore, defend, and remember. How far has the world fallen? How much is left to save? Last Loremaster features a myriad of different areas to explore and dozens of enemies to overcome, including familiar and new foes alike.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>6 unique ability sets you can switch between at will\u2013 one for each forbidden elemental Lore. <br></li><li>Fluid, high-octane combat system with physics-based animations.<br></li><li>Deep gear customization system, allowing you to choose the way you fight.<br></li><li>Stunning fantasy-apocalyptic world with Arabic inspiration and intricate lore.<br></li><li>Vast array of dozens of enemies to test your strength and strategy against.<br></li><li>Immersive, expressive, and impactful hand-crafted visuals, sound effects, and music</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854560/extras/2e690571bd09f56fc94ce5dac671ce06.poster.avif?t=1712155414\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854560/extras/2e690571bd09f56fc94ce5dac671ce06.webm?t=1712155414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854560/extras/2e690571bd09f56fc94ce5dac671ce06.mp4?t=1712155414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","developers":["The Bad Nomads"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854560/header.jpg?t=1712155414","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2854560/675689/677c7c50aad85d939d696da9cdb21647263d692e/1750947873/dash_av1.mpd?t=1711296440","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2854560/675689/677c7c50aad85d939d696da9cdb21647263d692e/