ing the encroaching Unravelling as you seamlessly freeze, burn, crush, and electrocute your foes!","steam_appid":2854560,"support_info":{"email":"info@thebadnomads.com","url":"https://thebadnomads.com/"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://thebadnomads.com/"}